f", "message": "Added a function to select search based an args, tied to C-s\n\nC-s to be isearch forward\nM-1 C-s helm-do-ag-this-file\nM-2 C-s helm-do-ag-buffers\nC-u C-s helm-do-ag-project-root", "created_at": "2019-09-27T19:29:14Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "49555115b269c7140ac1cf6664868108cb02ec50", "message": "Added prefix to C-s, C-s () -> helm-occur and C-s (P) -> helm-do-ag-project", "created_at": "2019-09-27T17:22:38Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c701e9d57d8cddcff568c5656eaad256ed39975f", "message": "allowed c-func-description to handle single line function.", "created_at": "2019-09-25T19:03:21Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2fde55a09f62cc8f1e46ddaf35cd660cb02445e7", "message": "Added a better c/c++ format on save", "created_at": "2019-09-24T05:56:28Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e64d36cc833bf9ddbffcda57222f5f55802b5053", "message": "Removed s-o as it was not emacs-ey", "created_at": "2019-09-24T05:46:05Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b680bb4e42f9744ab77fa911aaabbe2f02537f7e", "message": "c-func-description now accomidates \"type name(void)\" as a func with 0 args", "created_at": "2019-09-24T05:39:27Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c17663bb357dddd243ea383160b5bb037147024e", "message": "adding .gitignore", "created_at": "2019-09-23T04:00:23Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ec70e8254431e8d4c37d14762a3d5acdac17c9bb", "message": "c-func-description now accomidates &* and void", "created_at": "2019-09-23T03:58:38Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a12780abd8869304ec32d051c4e4ca946748b277", "message": "c-insert-func-description now supports decorators and no arguments", "created_at": "2019-09-23T03:36:55Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "863d709b5c453d2ebeb47b089695bee6f55dba6d", "message": "added some frame stuff", "created_at": "2019-09-23T02:46:55Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b6121420bba04442c6310e44a89d5cb49b7ecc92", "message": "Added new snippet: LaTeX_Verbatim", "created_at": "2019-09-22T20:18:17Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2c42c8cbc6c446421d0114f019399522581ddfa1", "message": "Added snap to functions for right and left. These only work on a single screen", "created_at": "2019-09-22T20:14:11Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2841a5c608672a1a2d442882cd75eb17db7feda4", "message": "Re-factor and moving latex-format to it's own repo.", "created_at": "2019-09-21T05:50:07Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e8d8cd7fbf2a23418caa79391b517a07498e735", "message": "Added lisp-interaction-mode kbd, (evil -1), prettify-latex-mode\n\nCreated a new minor mode to prettify .tex docs based on situational regrex", "created_at": "2019-09-18T04:34:16Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3b4f223ba92703df24741207fc309d009958f8c4", "message": "Re-factor + Multiple cursors + sentence-definition\n\n- I decided to enable auto-fill-mode in org-mode, so I re-factored my comments to\ncomply with auto-fill-mode. I set the org-mode column-fill to 120 chars.\n- I also disabled themes for terminal emulators. That means that colors will look like\nshit on terminal, but it also means the transition will be less jarring.\n- I changed the var sentence-end to include a sentence followed with any number\nof spaces >= 1.\n- I added a bind for evil-insert-state for \"C-S-;\"=\"C-:\"=>evil-ex\n- my-prog-mode is now run with less gobal, and more buffer local vars, and it\nnow is run as intended, a hook on prog-mode\n- my-text-mode is also run as a hook now, and it includes superword-mode and\nauto-fill-mode\n- Org is now kept up to date with github, instead of GNU-emacs.\n- ESS loads auto-loads instead of ess-site, helping with startup-time\n- I added \"-\" to the definition of a word for lisp-mode and emacs-lisp-mode\n- I added a latex shortcut for \\nn in the latex-skeleton. I also disabled\nprettily-symbol-mode\n - Added yasnippet for \\frac\n- I added multiple-cursors, and setup keybindings for it.", "created_at": "2019-09-14T01:56:17Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7b1a87f4c586f4c94efba602bd75fba548d6678d", "message": "Faster init time from change in straight", "created_at": "2019-09-11T22:03:34Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "41bb090df9f194618dfd6d8f527d4c148eacc7c7", "message": "remove-blak-up not works as expected", "created_at": "2019-09-11T08:34:35Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4a72e69ccd044020adfa802238a6a5af7af49526", "message": "Added a function to remove whitespace bound to C-x M-p", "created_at": "2019-09-11T07:36:56Z", "repo": "emacs-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}